Contracting States shall:

a) prevent unauthorized access, disclosure and use of PNR data; their legal framework shall provide penalties for misuse, unauthorized access, and unauthorized disclosure;
b) ensure that the safeguards applied to their collection, use, processing and protection of PNR data apply to all individuals without unlawful differentiation;
c) take measures to ensure that individuals are informed about the collection, use, processing and protection of PNR data and related privacy standards employed;
d) take measures to ensure that aircraft operators inform their customers about the transfer of PNR data;
